---
import { SITE } from '../../../data/site';
import Favicon from '../../../components/Favicon.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <title>Your first fix is on its way · {SITE.name}</title>
  <Favicon />
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/dm-sans-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/fraunces.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css" />
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0B1017; color: #F5F2EC; font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
    h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    p { color: #8B939E; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
    a { color: #3DB8A9; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 13px 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A8A7D, #156b62); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    ol { text-align: left; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 20px; color: #8B939E; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <h1>Check your email</h1>
    <p>The letter is being written right now and lands in your inbox in a few minutes: the one fix that moves your score most, written out in full, saying what your site does now, what to change, and how to check the change worked.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Copy the whole task, including the "Now" and "How to check" lines.</li>
      <li>Hand it to whoever looks after your site, or paste it into ChatGPT, Claude or Cursor.</li>
      <li>When it comes back, check it against the "How to check" line.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>You do not need to know any code. Your part is to say what to do and look at the result.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/pricing/">Get every fix, one a week: 7 days free, then 35 USD a month</a></p>
    <p><a href="/products/seo-audit/">Or a full one-off audit, 149 USD</a> · <a href="/ai-visibility/">Check another site</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
